^Kubernetes e2e suite (\[sig-api-machinery\] Garbage collector should keep the rc around until all its pods are deleted if the deleteOptions says so \[Conformance\] \[Serial\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] AdmissionWebhook \[Privileged:ClusterAdmin\] listing validating webhooks should work \[Conformance\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] CustomResourceDefinition resources \[Privileged:ClusterAdmin\] custom resource defaulting for requests and from storage works \[Conformance\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] ResourceQuota should create a ResourceQuota and capture the life of a configMap\. \[Conformance\]|\[sig-apps\] Deployment deployment should delete old replica sets \[Conformance\]|\[sig-apps\] ReplicationController should release no longer matching pods \[Conformance\]|\[sig-auth\] \[FeatureGate:ClusterTrustBundle\] \[FeatureGate:ClusterTrustBundleProjection\] should be able to mount a single ClusterTrustBundle by name \[MinimumKubeletVersion:1\.37\] \[Conformance\]|\[sig-network\] DNS should provide DNS for ExternalName services \[Conformance\]|\[sig-network\] Services should be able to change the type from NodePort to ExternalName \[Conformance\]|\[sig-node\] Downward API should provide default limits\.cpu/memory from node allocatable \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-node\] Pods should be updated \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-node\] Security Context should support container\.SecurityContext\.RunAsUser And container\.SecurityContext\.RunAsGroup \[LinuxOnly\] \[Conformance\]|\[sig-storage\] ConfigMap should be consumable in multiple volumes in the same pod \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-storage\] Projected combined should project all components that make up the projection API \[Projection\] \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-storage\] Secrets should be consumable from pods in volume with defaultMode set \[LinuxOnly\] \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\])$
